{"id":"vod_bf_119411","vodId":"119411","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"非人学生与厌世教师","name_cn":"非人学生与厌世教师","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260111-1/0c6b60c3281c302166c7ec8c81d52587.jpg"},"summary":"她们不是人类。但是，比任何人都憧憬着人类 对人间关系有心理阴影的奔三NEET：人间零。这样的我，刚想着要转职山清水秀的山区学校，过着优哉游哉的复健教师生活——那儿居然是为了让人外成为人类而设立的女校？！ 人鱼族水月镜花、狼人尾尾守一咲、兔子右左美彗、鸟羽根田帷……与这样不可思议的学生们渡过的日子。为什么想要成为人类，成为人类了想要干什么——我通过她们学习着“人类”。 这既不是异世界奇幻，也不是转生人生重来。只不过是一所奇怪的学校，与向着成为人类努力的人外女子们一起渡过的，一位教师的故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-05 02:20:33","episodeCount":13,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/c98adb49ab6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/392183da0fd8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/422f75f0a6ed/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/e24e50805d3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/0449c1cee598/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/de612ce46ef7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/b9b1a9064750/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/8d0b33bd98a1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/0b4db8869164/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/8a184f511415/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/feirenxueshengyuyanshijiaoshi/cceb6d4b6a5f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/